{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001921963","cik":"0001921963","slug":"atmus-filtration-technologies-921963","name":"Atmus Filtration Technologies Inc.","ticker":"ATMU","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Motor Vehicle Parts & Accessories","sic":"3714","country":"TN","website":"","listed_years":2.5,"first_annual":"2024-02-14","last_filing":"2026-07-31","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001921963&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Atmus Filtration Technologies Inc. files with the SEC under \"Motor Vehicle Parts & Accessories\", based in TN, and has been publicly reporting for 2 years.","It reported $1.8bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 14.6% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 28.6%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($101.4m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 14.6% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $477.5m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1921963/000192196326000042/0001921963-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001921963-26-000042"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in 6 of the last 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1921963/000192196326000042/0001921963-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001921963-26-000042"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 26.5% to 28.6% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1921963/000192196326000042/0001921963-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001921963-26-000042"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at